        "Content": "Hume Auctioneers - We Get The Pick Of The Crop.\n\nSet amidst beautiful rolling countryside just outside The Swan, this magnificent detached residence offers a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial family home finished to an exceptionally high standard throughout. Extending over three levels and enjoying wonderful views across the surrounding landscape, this impressive property combines generous proportions, quality craftsmanship and versatile accommodation.\nApproached through impressive electric entrance gates flanked by handsome stone wing walls, this stunning property immediately conveys a sense of quality and arrival. A sweeping gravel driveway winds through the grounds before opening onto an expansive parking and turning area to the front and side of the residence.\nOccupying an exceptional site extending to almost 3 acres, the property enjoys complete privacy together with magnificent panoramic views across the surrounding countryside. \nThe residence is set amidst extensive landscaped lawns, mature planting, specimen trees and attractive stone-bordered gravel pathways. A large elevated terrace provides the perfect setting for outdoor dining and entertaining whilst enjoying uninterrupted views over the rolling countryside.\nThe lands are divided into two large paddocks, securely enclosed and ideally suited to horses, ponies or small livestock. Adjoining the paddocks is a useful stable and outbuildings, providing excellent facilities for equestrian enthusiasts or those seeking a country lifestyle.\nAdding further charm is a stunning timber-framed outdoor entertainment pavilion, creating a wonderful all-season retreat for relaxing, entertaining guests or enjoying peaceful evenings overlooking the grounds.\nThe elevated setting ensures the property commands breathtaking views in every direction, whilst mature boundary hedging and fencing provide excellent privacy and security.\nFrom the moment you step into the welcoming entrance hall, the quality and attention to detail are immediately apparent. Elegant wall panelling, feature staircase and bright open spaces create a warm and inviting first impression.\nThe accommodation is exceptionally well designed, with a superb balance of formal and family living spaces. A magnificent living room enjoys excellent natural light and provides an ideal setting for entertaining, while the spectacular sitting room boasts a vaulted ceiling with exposed timber trusses, a feature brick fireplace and panoramic countryside views. At the heart of the home lies a spacious kitchen and dining area complete with handcrafted cabinetry, pantry and adjoining laundry room.\nThe first floor offers four generous bedrooms together with a selection of beautifully appointed bathrooms. The principal bedroom suite enjoys excellent proportions and extensive dressing space, creating a luxurious private retreat.\nA major feature of the property is the substantial basement level, which incorporates a large open-plan kitchen/living area, additional bedroom, bathroom, utility room and an enormous garage/workshop. This versatile space is ideal for extended family living, guest accommodation, a home business or recreational use.\nThroughout the house, quality finishes including natural stone flooring, timber detailing, bespoke joinery and tasteful décor combine to create a home of exceptional character and comfort.\nOutside, the property enjoys a commanding setting with mature landscaping and uninterrupted views of the surrounding countryside.\nEnjoying a picturesque and peaceful setting in the heart of The Swan, County Laois, this property combines the charm of country living with excellent accessibility. A variety of amenities, schools, sporting facilities, shops and dining options can be found nearby in Athy, Abbeyleix, Portlaoise and Carlow, while excellent transport links and easy access to the M7 and M8 motorways make commuting to Dublin, Kilkenny and the wider South East straightforward and convenient.\nB3 Rated. Qualifies for Green Mortgage.\nGeothermal Heating System\nFurther lands available if required.\n"
